{
  "schema_version": "1.0",
  "encounter_id": "01053",
  "segments": [
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0001",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 1.15,
      "end_seconds": 4.08,
      "duration_seconds": 2.93,
      "text": "Sorry I'm a little late, doctor."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0002",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 5.56,
      "end_seconds": 10.72,
      "duration_seconds": 5.16,
      "text": "You're alright, take a a seat. What can I do for you?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0003",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 11.35,
      "end_seconds": 14.91,
      "duration_seconds": 3.56,
      "text": "well, I've been having bloating after meals"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0004",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 19.05,
      "end_seconds": 23.92,
      "duration_seconds": 4.87,
      "text": "Can you list what you take, tablets, creams or inhalers?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0005",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 24.52,
      "end_seconds": 39.07,
      "duration_seconds": 14.55,
      "text": "Escitalopram, 10 milligrams, once a day for the anxiety. I've been reading about it online and it worried me. I didn't want to bother you but it keeps coming back"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0006",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 40.63,
      "end_seconds": 41.92,
      "duration_seconds": 1.29,
      "text": "Since when exactly?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0007",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 43.68,
      "end_seconds": 47.07,
      "duration_seconds": 3.39,
      "text": "It's been like this since Friday."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0008",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 47.78,
      "end_seconds": 50.03,
      "duration_seconds": 2.25,
      "text": "what eases it, if anything?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0009",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 51.25,
      "end_seconds": 55.89,
      "duration_seconds": 4.64,
      "text": "ah, uh, only walking, and it's not much"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0010",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 56.47,
      "end_seconds": 59.39,
      "duration_seconds": 2.92,
      "text": "have you noticed anything else alongside it?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0011",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 61.32,
      "end_seconds": 70.84,
      "duration_seconds": 9.52,
      "text": "It usually comes with loose stools now and then. The loose stools now and then? That's been for three weeks."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0012",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 72.76,
      "end_seconds": 75.25,
      "duration_seconds": 2.49,
      "text": "what aggravates it, if anything?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0013",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 77.53,
      "end_seconds": 81.22,
      "duration_seconds": 3.69,
      "text": "Well, I notice it more with stress."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0014",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 82.97,
      "end_seconds": 86.69,
      "duration_seconds": 3.72,
      "text": "A few quick ones: night-time diarrhoea or weight loss?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0015",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 88.54,
      "end_seconds": 92.5,
      "duration_seconds": 3.96,
      "text": "Yeah, no, I haven't had any of them."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0016",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 92.85,
      "end_seconds": 98.49,
      "duration_seconds": 5.64,
      "text": "okay, go on. A few quick ones: blood in the stool or vomiting?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0017",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 100.08,
      "end_seconds": 106.65,
      "duration_seconds": 6.57,
      "text": "Oh, um, I haven't had blood in the stool or vomiting, no."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0018",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 107.32,
      "end_seconds": 110.56,
      "duration_seconds": 3.24,
      "text": "Anything with your nerves, like weakness or numbness?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0019",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 112.64,
      "end_seconds": 114.59,
      "duration_seconds": 1.95,
      "text": "No, nothing like that."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0020",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 115.11,
      "end_seconds": 118.61,
      "duration_seconds": 3.5,
      "text": "How about your heart, any problems like that?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0021",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 119.47,
      "end_seconds": 122.15,
      "duration_seconds": 2.68,
      "text": "No, nothing with my heart."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0022",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 136.17,
      "end_seconds": 140.42,
      "duration_seconds": 4.25,
      "text": "What about your parents, brothers or sisters, any conditions?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0023",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 142.14,
      "end_seconds": 146.95,
      "duration_seconds": 4.81,
      "text": "Okay, you know, so my daughter has type 1 diabetes."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0024",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 157.17,
      "end_seconds": 158.99,
      "duration_seconds": 1.82,
      "text": "How active are you?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0025",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 159.62,
      "end_seconds": 163.15,
      "duration_seconds": 3.53,
      "text": "I hardly move around during the day."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0026",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 163.98,
      "end_seconds": 166.47,
      "duration_seconds": 2.49,
      "text": "do you follow any particular diet?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0027",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 167.84,
      "end_seconds": 171.02,
      "duration_seconds": 3.18,
      "text": "I'm vegetarian and have been for years."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0028",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 173.08,
      "end_seconds": 176.16,
      "duration_seconds": 3.08,
      "text": "Are you in work at the moment?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0029",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 177.56,
      "end_seconds": 181.42,
      "duration_seconds": 3.86,
      "text": "Yes, I work in a bakery, early starts."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0030",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 196.32,
      "end_seconds": 201.4,
      "duration_seconds": 5.08,
      "text": "Are you allergic to anything? Any allergies to medicines or foods?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0031",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 202.14,
      "end_seconds": 207.06,
      "duration_seconds": 4.92,
      "text": "Yes, amoxicillin, it gives me a rash all over."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0032",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 208.4,
      "end_seconds": 212.24,
      "duration_seconds": 3.84,
      "text": "any health conditions I should have on record?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0033",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 216.58,
      "end_seconds": 217.78,
      "duration_seconds": 1.2,
      "text": "Yes, anxiety."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0034",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 218.32,
      "end_seconds": 226.33,
      "duration_seconds": 8.01,
      "text": "Mm-hmm. Okay, I can see anxiety in your file as well. Right, I'll note down your vital signs first."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0035",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 239.52,
      "end_seconds": 242.67,
      "duration_seconds": 3.15,
      "text": "So, bear with me while this finishes..."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0036",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 252.14,
      "end_seconds": 258.62,
      "duration_seconds": 6.48,
      "text": "okay: blood pressure 123 over 77, temp 36.9 degrees, pulse is 70 beats a minute"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0037",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 260.55,
      "end_seconds": 263.1,
      "duration_seconds": 2.55,
      "text": "Well, is that alright, doctor?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0038",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 264.84,
      "end_seconds": 267.53,
      "duration_seconds": 2.69,
      "text": "We'll look at it together shortly."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0039",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 268.86,
      "end_seconds": 272.83,
      "duration_seconds": 3.97,
      "text": "Let me look at the area, I'll be gentle."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0040",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 274.82,
      "end_seconds": 275.94,
      "duration_seconds": 1.12,
      "text": "That's alright."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0041",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 277.71,
      "end_seconds": 279.19,
      "duration_seconds": 1.48,
      "text": "look straight ahead"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0042",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 293.41,
      "end_seconds": 298.67,
      "duration_seconds": 5.26,
      "text": "your tummy is soft and not tender, and I can't feel any lumps"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0043",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 301.27,
      "end_seconds": 315.74,
      "duration_seconds": 14.47,
      "text": "Thank you, you can get dressed. From what you've told me and what I found, I think we're dealing with a functional bowel pattern, with no alarm features at this stage."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0044",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 320.0,
      "end_seconds": 322.11,
      "duration_seconds": 2.11,
      "text": "is this serious, doctor?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0045",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 327.54,
      "end_seconds": 336.86,
      "duration_seconds": 9.32,
      "text": "It's reasonable to be concerned, but right now a functional bowel pattern, with no alarm features is my leading thought, not anything worse."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0046",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 347.06,
      "end_seconds": 363.19,
      "duration_seconds": 16.13,
      "text": "I'd like to arrange a coeliac blood test for bloating. Try smaller meals and keep a food and symptom diary for four weeks. Book a review in six weeks. Anything else on your mind before you go?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0047",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 364.78,
      "end_seconds": 366.88,
      "duration_seconds": 2.1,
      "text": "Thank you, doctor, goodbye."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0048",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 368.2,
      "end_seconds": 369.4,
      "duration_seconds": 1.2,
      "text": "all the best"
    }
  ]
}